  "slug": "strawberry-melon-gazpacho",
  "title": "Strawberry Melon Gazpacho",
  "blurb": "A chilled summer soup made by blending fresh watermelon, cantaloupe, strawberries and cucumber with lime juice. Serve cold on warm days.",
  "steps": [
    "Set aside about 100g of the strawberries and a small handful of the watermelon and cantaloupe chunks for garnish.",
    "Put the remaining watermelon, cantaloupe, cucumber and strawberries into a blender with the lime juice.",
    "Blend until completely smooth, then taste and add more lime juice if needed.",
    "Pour into a jug and chill in the fridge for at least 30 minutes.",
    "Chop the reserved fruit into small pieces.",
    "Ladle the gazpacho into bowls and top with the chopped fruit and torn mint leaves."
